{"id":"9fa59a08139e4466","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-linear-operator.md","title":"Linear Operator","display":"df-linear-operator — Linear Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-linear-operator","aliases":["58-df-linear-operator","Linear Operator"],"display":"df-linear-operator — Linear Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-linear-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-linear-operator</span><span>Linear Operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-linear-operator — Linear Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (normed spaces over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbb K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\\)</span> (normed-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in Y^X\">\\(T\\in Y^X\\)</span> (map candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\)</span> (linearity predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\)</span> (bounded-linear-operator predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> (operator norm defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(X,Y)\">\\(\\mathcal L(X,Y)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(X)\">\\(\\mathcal L(X)\\)</span> (operator spaces defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y)\\land T\\in Y^X\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq C\\|x\\|_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y)\\land T\\in Y^X\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq C\\|x\\|_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal L(X,Y) \\coloneqq \\{T\\in Y^X:\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal L(X,Y) \\coloneqq \\{T\\in Y^X:\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}norm} \\vdash \\forall T\\in\\mathcal L(X,Y)\\;\\left(\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=\\sup\\{\\|T(x)\\|_Y:x\\in X\\land\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}norm} \\vdash \\forall T\\in\\mathcal L(X,Y)\\;\\left(\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=\\sup\\{\\|T(x)\\|_Y:x\\in X\\land\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}endomorphism} \\vdash \\mathcal L(X) \\coloneqq \\mathcal L(X,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}endomorphism} \\vdash \\mathcal L(X) \\coloneqq \\mathcal L(X,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Linear operator: bounded if norm finite; continuous if and only if bounded</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> is Banach, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(X,Y)\">\\(\\mathcal L(X,Y)\\)</span> is Banach in the operator norm; this is a theorem, not part of the definition.</li>\n<li>Finite-dimensional: all linear operators bounded; infinite dimension needed</li>\n<li>Spectrum: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(T) = \\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb{C}\\mid \\neg\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(T-\\lambda I)\\}\">\\(\\sigma(T) = \\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb{C}\\mid \\neg\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(T-\\lambda I)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A compact operator maps bounded sets to relatively compact sets; Riesz--Schauder then controls its nonzero spectrum.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S$ (normed-space predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y)\\land T\\in Y^X\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq C\\|x\\|_X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal L(X,Y) \\coloneqq \\{T\\in Y^X:\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}norm} \\vdash \\forall T\\in\\mathcal L(X,Y)\\;\\left(\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=\\sup\\{\\|T(x)\\|_Y:x\\in X\\land\\|x\\|_X\\leq1\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}operator\\text{-}endomorphism} \\vdash \\mathcal L(X) \\coloneqq \\mathcal L(X,X)","display":true},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(T) = \\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb{C}\\mid \\neg\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(T-\\lambda I)\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2199,"backlinks":[{"id":"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)$ (bounded-linear-operator predicate, see [[58-df-linear-operator]])"},{"id":"961e3f5fd41019e9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8cd200016e351244","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1172b58e7f71b034","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}$ (bounded-linear predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-linear-operator.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-787","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-linear-operator.md|58-df-linear-operator]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["f67456d74b418241","bdbbe5a00af04978"]}